wave-initial-phi.conf - Wave propagator started from a nonuniform initial phi.
Propagator 1 gives phi as one value per node (issue 127), a Gaussian bump of
height 10 centred on node 137 (row 9, column 9 of a 16x16 torus) on top of
the stimulus rate Q = 1. With constant input the bump spreads out as a
damped wave, so by symmetry the responses at nodes 133 and 141 (left/right)
and 73 and 201 (up/down) must agree to round-off. The dendrite starts at its
steady state nu*phi, node by node.
